OL,3,AXbox boss 'thinking about
OL,4,Aaffordability' of next-gen console
OL,5,
OL,6,FXbox chief executive Asha Sharma says
OL,7,Fthe gaming giant needs to be "thinking
OL,8,Fabout" affordability for its
OL,9,Fnext-generation console, amid a
OL,10,F"crisis" in computing prices.
OL,12,FIn an interview with the BBC, she said
OL,13,Frising hardware costs partly driven by
OL,14,FAI spending mean firms need to find
OL,15,Fways to make gaming affordable.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
