OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AXbox boss 'thinking about
OL,4,Aaffordability' of next-gen console
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also revealed gamers will soon be
OL,7,Fable to get digital versions of many of
OL,8,Fthe physical games they currently own,
OL,9,Fpotentially meaning their old games can
OL,10,Fbe played on future Xbox consoles
OL,11,Fwithout having to put a disc in a
OL,12,Fdrive.
OL,14,F"I know players love physical media,
OL,15,Fand I know there's a lot of benefits in
OL,16,Fdigital media, and I want to make sure
OL,17,Fpeople have a choice," Sharma said.
